Wolf decided not to be greedy especially because the girl was small and skinny. Without a haste he went into the forest.
Soon afterwards Red Hood and woodcutters reached the hut. 
Rat-tat: she hammered with a fist on the door.
Silence.
-Step aside girl, - one of the men slightly pushed her aside and hit the door with his giant fist.
Silence.
Then woodcutter hit the door with his strong shoulder and broke in. Red Hood and her followers entered the hut, but nobody was inside. Only a cap, glasses and torn chemise were lying on the floor.

....and remaining pasties were eaten by the woodcutters.
THE END 